Cell["\<\
Skipped: R-S3-1p1d-generator, R-S4-1p1d-generator, R-S4c-1p1d-generator. \
These compare with reference CSVs of the 1+1D derivations of the consistent \
first and second moment and of the $c_M$ coupling, which are read only when \
\\texttt{FLUIDUM\\_EXTERNAL\\_REFPOINTS} names a directory holding them; it \
was unset.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"3e98a7ff-5db1-446e-afa3-7208a345d234"],

